# Thermal Environment in Schools.

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
This publication attempts to provide some basic descriptions of the various systems and components of climate control and to point out some of the factors to be considered in the selection of the mechanical equipment. The principles of heat gain and loss and ventilation as they relate to a comfortable temperature are discussed. Illustrative figures accompany the written text. (Author)

